  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="980" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Certificate of Occupancy workflow continuity</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1080" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">The platform does not stop at permit intake. It supports review, approval, signing, and registration continuity across Certificate of Occupancy and related land-rights workflows.</text>
